:"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-18T06:37:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T14:26:02Z","closed_at":"2026-07-24T14:25:36Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.1-stable, 4.7.1-stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.1.stable - Ubuntu 26.04 LTS 26.04 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 (nvidia; 580.159.03) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-14600K (20 threads) - 61.31 GiB memory - PulseAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the Compatibility renderer, the SCREEN_UV builtin is measured in pixel coordinates rather than UV coordinates. This causes wild visual incongruity between the renderers.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a WorldEnvironment with a Sky background\n- Set the sky material to a ShaderMaterial\n- Assign the following shader to the material:\n```\nshader_type sky;\n\nvoid sky() {\n\tCOLOR = vec3(SCREEN_UV.xyx / 10.);\n}\n```\n- Switch between Compatibility and Forward+ renderers, and observe incongruity:\n\nForward+:\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70bcc76c-d857-49a3-ad31-3f4b6a9022d8\" />\n\nMobile:\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/35b94ea7-6740-4da5-b0c0-553dde37d5e1\" />\n\nCompatibility:\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e9996d5-f607-4f05-b37d-f6a834c0dd2b\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[screen-uv-range-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30147369/screen-uv-range-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":